WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.013 --> 00:00:12.673
Choose which wallets to include in the budget

2
00:00:12.673 --> 00:00:15.595
Choose when to receive a budget alert. The default is 80%

3
00:00:15.595 --> 00:00:30.359
Tap the total budget to change the amount with the calculator

4
00:00:30.359 --> 00:00:33.821
Allocate money with the category slider

5
00:00:33.821 --> 00:00:36.637
Lock an allocation that should stay fixed

6
00:00:36.637 --> 00:01:02.433
Save, then review the budget and spending in Reports
